The estimated insertion ages of RLG_Cereba, RLG_Ava and RLG_Beth (see respective age_distribution_clean_filtered_all) in OT3098 were used to define the 20th age percentile per chromosome. All insertions with ages at or below the 20th percentile per chromosome were used in the subsequent analysis. The centromere positions (see this GitHub repository file Wicker-Lab/Avena_centromere_analysis/Figure_1_Figures_S5_S6_S8_S10/ChiP_inferred_centromere_positions_OT3098) were used to define copies within the centromere.
